<div class="woocommerce-Tabs-panel panel entry-content wc-tab woocommerce-Tabs-panel--description" id="tab-description" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="tab-title-description" data-accordion-index="description">
<p>10 years, 20 releases. This is the last of them. Label head Inter Gritty at the controls, delivering four tracks of techno with a twist. Over &#038; out from Random Island HQ &#8211; it&#8217;s been real!</p>
</div>
<div class="woocommerce-Tabs-panel panel entry-content wc-tab woocommerce-Tabs-panel--brand_tab" id="tab-brand_tab" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="tab-title-brand_tab" data-accordion-index="brand_tab">
Founded in 2012 by DJ &amp; producer Inter Gritty and based in Norrköping, Sweden.							</div>
<div class="woocommerce-Tabs-panel panel entry-content wc-tab woocommerce-Tabs-panel--wd_additional_tab" id="tab-wd_additional_tab" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="tab-title-wd_additional_tab" data-accordion-index="wd_additional_tab">
<div class="wpb-content-wrapper" id="wpb-content-root"><div class="vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid"><div class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-12"><div class="vc_column-inner"><div class="wpb_wrapper">
<div class="wpb_text_column wpb_content_element" >
<div class="wpb_wrapper">
<p>We do our best to make shipping as convenient as possible for you.<br />
We currently use services from <a href="https://www.packeta.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span style="text-decoration: underline;">Packeta.com</span></a></p>
<p><strong>International Orders</strong><br />
It is the customer's responsibility to comply with all local Customs authority requirements. Additional import duties, customs and local sales taxes may be required in order to release the goods from customs. We recommend that you make yourself aware of these requirements before placing your order.</p>
<p><strong>We currently send packages in the EU area.</strong></p>
<p><strong>Europe</strong><br />
Delivery time 3 - 7 days from 7,5 €<br />
Tracked Delivery</p>
<p><strong>Slovakia &amp; Czech Republic </strong><br />
Packeta Pick up Delivery time 2 - 3 days from 5,5 €<br />
Tracked Delivery</p>
<p><strong>Slovakia</strong></p>
<p>Packeta HD Delivery time 2 - 3 days from 6,8 €<br />
Tracked Delivery</p>
<p><strong>Czech Republic</strong><br />
Packeta HD Delivery time 2 - 3 days from 5,5 €<br />
Tracked Delivery</p>
<p>Please note all shipping prices are calculated upon the weight of the basket at checkout.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div></div></div></div></div>							</div>
<div class="woocommerce-Tabs-panel panel entry-content wc-tab woocommerce-Tabs-panel--wd_additional_tab_2" id="tab-wd_additional_tab_2" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="tab-title-wd_additional_tab_2" data-accordion-index="wd_additional_tab_2">
